    "detailed_description": "First released in 2014 to much acclaim, &quot;50 Pinch Barrage!!&quot; is back and better than ever!<br><br><strong>Use your heroic wit and technique to escape a gauntlet of pinches and traps!! Cinematic pinch-delivering action.</strong><br><br>\u30fbYou're a treasure hunter who's crash-landed on a remote desert island.<br>Can you overcome a relentless gauntlet of pinches and traps and safely escape the island\u2026?!<br><br>\u30fbThe controls used in the game is simple!<br>All kinds of terrain, traps, and enemies will stand in your way, but as the player, please do your best to figure out all the maneuvers and ways of getting out of each pinch!<br><br>\u30fbThis game features a replay function that allows all play during the game to be recorded and replayed later on. An online ranking system in which all players can compete with clear-times globally is also featured.<br><br>\u30fbWhile preserving the game\u2019s core fun as is, we\u2019ve enhanced the playability of the new and improved \u201c50 Pinch Barrage!\u201d in certain areas based on the original version\u2019s stages. We\u2019ve also improved the game\u2019s graphics, and it's overall easier to play now!<br><br>*The Free Edition is an original stage in which you can train your action gameplay skills.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Guideline</h2><strong>Regardless of whether it\u2019s an individual or a brand, we welcome all streamers!</strong><br><br>We have a simple streaming guideline, so we request that you check it before streaming our game.<br><br>We\u2019ve also prepared assets for streaming purposes. Please check the official \u201c50 Pinch Barrage!!\u201d homepage for more details.",
    "about_the_game": "First released in 2014 to much acclaim, &quot;50 Pinch Barrage!!&quot; is back and better than ever!<br><br><strong>Use your heroic wit and technique to escape a gauntlet of pinches and traps!! Cinematic pinch-delivering action.</strong><br><br>\u30fbYou're a treasure hunter who's crash-landed on a remote desert island.<br>Can you overcome a relentless gauntlet of pinches and traps and safely escape the island\u2026?!<br><br>\u30fbThe controls used in the game is simple!<br>All kinds of terrain, traps, and enemies will stand in your way, but as the player, please do your best to figure out all the maneuvers and ways of getting out of each pinch!<br><br>\u30fbThis game features a replay function that allows all play during the game to be recorded and replayed later on. An online ranking system in which all players can compete with clear-times globally is also featured.<br><br>\u30fbWhile preserving the game\u2019s core fun as is, we\u2019ve enhanced the playability of the new and improved \u201c50 Pinch Barrage!\u201d in certain areas based on the original version\u2019s stages. We\u2019ve also improved the game\u2019s graphics, and it's overall easier to play now!<br><br>*The Free Edition is an original stage in which you can train your action gameplay skills.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Guideline</h2><strong>Regardless of whether it\u2019s an individual or a brand, we welcome all streamers!</strong><br><br>We have a simple streaming guideline, so we request that you check it before streaming our game.<br><br>We\u2019ve also prepared assets for streaming purposes. Please check the official \u201c50 Pinch Barrage!!\u201d homepage for more details.",
